<title>USA: Smith Barney wins Virginia Public School $132 mln.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney wins Virginia Public School $132 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Wednesday it won a $132 million Virginia Public School Authority school financing bond issue, 1991 Resolution, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.198 percent.</p>
</text>
